exports[`Lumen & Loom Studio > Brand System › 1. Ambassador > tile aesthetics 1`] = `
"AestheticsAestheticsiA maker in their thirties in a well-worn oatmeal linen apron over undyed wool knitwear, sleeves pushed up. Natural fibres only, in cream, clay, moss green and indigo. Short nails, a little lanolin on the hands, a faint smell of wool and cedar. Always framed by the studio: north light through tall windows, looms in the background, spools of yarn on open shelves.Back‹›AestheticsBody LanguageCommunication & VoiceImprintBack
