"Communication & VoiceCommunication & VoiceiCalm, mid-low pitch, unhurried pace. Speaks plainly and specifically, naming the farm, the yarn weight and the hours a piece took, and explains craft terms the first time they come up. Short sentences, British spelling, gentle humour, no hype words (no 'luxury', no 'curated'). Asks questions and listens.Back‹›AestheticsBody LanguageCommunication & VoiceImprintBack
