"CapabilityCapabilityGapsiNo one on the team has run e-commerce and digital marketing at scale, or managed textile production beyond our own looms.CoveriA freelance e-commerce specialist covers the online shop and digital marketing for the first year while Oliver completes a digital marketing course. A retired mill production manager mentors us on sourcing and small-batch production. Hale & Co Accountants and our lawyer cover year-end accounts and legal work, and we plan to hire and train an apprentice weaver to add studio production capacity.Back‹›CapabilityRegistrationsExpensesBack
